{
  "body_human_readable": "The tools mentioned for working with ontologies are:\n\n1. Prot\u00e9g\u00e9\n2. TopBraid Composer\n3. OntoStudio (and its predecessor OntoEdit)\n4. Fluent Editor\n5. VocBench 3\n6. Swoop\n7. OBO-Edit\n\nThese tools are discussed and compared in terms of their features, usability, scalability, stability, integration, documentation, and originality in the provided documents [1] [2] [3] [4] [5] [6].",
